# CineAI — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env

# ── TMDB API Key (REQUIRED for real movie posters) ────────────
# Get your free key at: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# 1. Create a free account on themoviedb.org
# 2. Go to Settings → API → Request an API Key → Developer
# 3. Fill in the form (use "personal/educational" as purpose)
# 4. Copy the "API Key (v3 auth)" value below:
TMDB_API_KEY=your_tmdb_api_key_here

# ── Kaggle credentials (for kagglehub auto-download) ─────────
# Alternatively: place your CSVs manually in data/raw/
# If using kagglehub, download kaggle.json from:
#   https://www.kaggle.com/settings → API → Create New Token
# Then place kaggle.json at:  ~/.kaggle/kaggle.json   (Linux/Mac)
#                              C:\Users\<user>\.kaggle\kaggle.json  (Windows)
